guide forever/class/mage/mages-wand
title Mage's Wand
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
levels 30-40
zone Dustwallow Marsh
keywords Journey to the Marsh, Tabetha, Hidden Secrets, Magus Tirth, Get the Scoop, Plucky Johnson, Rituals of Power, Scarlet Monastery, Library, Items of Power, Jade, Witherbark Totem Stick, Bolt Charged Bramble, Arathi Highlands, Icefury Wand, Nether Force Wand, Ragefire Wand, Mage, class wand
reward item 7514 11263 7513
why A wand of your school for the 30s: frost, arcane or fire.

# Tabetha's wand chain, both factions: Journey to the Marsh (1947), Hidden
# Secrets (1949), Get the Scoop (1950), Rituals of Power (1951), Items of Power
# (1948) and Mage's Wand (1952).
# Levels 30-40: the Forever beta stops at 30 until launch on 4 November, so
# this guide is based on data, not play.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the chain,
# "Plucky" Johnson's spot, the Witherbark trolls and the Bolt Charged Bramble;
# Forever's Mage class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/, all six unchanged) and
# quest data (quests 1947 to 1952, checked
# 2026-10-14) for the givers and the reward choice (Icefury, Nether Force or
# Ragefire Wand); the quest texts for Tabetha's cottage and the Scarlet
# Monastery; codex/instances.json for the Scarlet Monastery Library entrance.
# Details Forever's data lacks come from a Classic guide to the mage class
# quests (2023-11-09): the /beckon for "Plucky" Johnson, the book's place in
# the Library, and the ten Witherbark Totem Sticks that become the Bolt Charged
# Bramble. Items of Power is taken after Rituals of Power, in the order that
# guide gives (our data would let Tabetha offer it at once).
# Rituals of Power is dungeon work: the book lies in the Scarlet Monastery
# Library (a group of five, level 29-39).

step Journey to the Marsh (Stormwind)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon in the Wizard's Sanctum, Stormwind's Mage Quarter, sends you to Tabetha; Bink in Ironforge gives the same quest.
  level 30
  accept 1947 npc 5497                        -- Jennea Cannon

step Journey to the Marsh (Orgrimmar)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Deino, one of Orgrimmar's mage trainers, sends you to Tabetha; Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity and Ursyn Ghull in Thunder Bluff give the same quest.
  level 30
  accept 1947 npc 5885                        -- Deino

step Tabetha
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Tabetha, a hermit, lives in a cottage deep in the marsh west of Theramore, just north of the Stonemaul Ruins.
  turnin 1947                                 -- Tabetha
  accept 1949

step Magus Tirth
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Magus Tirth spends his days at the race track in the Shimmering Flats, south-east Thousand Needles.
  turnin 1949                                 -- Magus Tirth
  accept 1950

step "Plucky" Johnson
  tip Tirth's apprentice is "Plucky" Johnson, a small grey chicken by the race track. Target him and type /beckon: he turns human for a moment, long enough to talk to him.
  complete 1950 @79.6,75.6                    -- "Plucky" Johnson
  turnin 1950                                 -- Magus Tirth
  accept 1951

step Rituals of Power
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Tirth sold the book to the Scarlet Brotherhood. The Scarlet Monastery stands in north-eastern Tirisfal Glades; take the Library wing. The book juts out of the wall on the left as you enter the Athenaeum, before Arcanist Doan.
  collect 7274 quest 1951.1 @82.6,33.8        -- Rituals of Power: Scarlet Monastery Library

step Back to Tabetha
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  turnin 1951                                 -- Tabetha
  accept 1948

step Witherbark trolls
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip The Witherbark trolls hold south-eastern Arathi Highlands; every one of them can drop a Witherbark Totem Stick. Then take the ten sticks north-west to the binding circle where they become the Bolt Charged Bramble. Tabetha also wants a Jade: buy one at an Auction House on the way; miners sometimes find one in Tin Veins.
  collect 7273 x10                            -- Witherbark Totem Stick
  collect 7272 quest 1948.2                   -- Bolt Charged Bramble
  collect 1529 quest 1948.1                   -- Jade

step Tabetha's ritual
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  turnin 1948                                 -- Tabetha
  accept 1952
  turnin 1952 choose 7514 11263 7513          -- Mage's Wand
